    <briefdescription>
<para>BTF_KIND_STRUCT and BTF_KIND_UNION are followed by multiple &quot;struct BTFMember&quot;. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The exact number of <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_b_t_f_1_1_b_t_f_member" kindref="compound">BTFMember</ref> is stored in the vlen (of the info in &quot;struct CommonType&quot;).</para>
<para>If the struct/union contains any bitfield member, the Offset below represents BitOffset (bits 0 - 23) and BitFieldSize(bits 24 - 31) with BitFieldSize = 0 for non bitfield members. Otherwise, the Offset represents the BitOffset. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
